      "id": "2073799023413051546",
      "text": "Some apps are built for perfect routines.\n\nTiimo is built for the days when even starting feels hard.\n\nDesigned for people with ADHD, autism, dyslexia, and executive function challenges, it replaces overwhelming to-do lists with visual timelines, routines, timers, and gentle reminders.\n\n📊 A few numbers:\n🏆 Apple’s iPhone App of the Year 2025\n🥇 Apple Design Awards Finalist 2024\n📲 3M+ downloads worldwide\n\nThe team didn’t build another productivity app.\n\nThey built one for people who needed a gentler way to move through the day.\n\nSometimes that’s the real product.",
