      "id": "2073772923459170724",
      "text": "@bevel_health \nI hope you guys can see this. I can’t give you a review on the iOS App Store because I’m on iOS 27 beta 2.\n\nI have loved the app so far. The design is fantastic, and the Bevel Assistant integration seems to work well.\n\nBut I would only give it three stars because when transcribing, the app completely loses the entire transcription, even though it looks like it’s still recording when the iPhone locks, returns to the home screen, and goes to sleep. You should add a setting to keep the phone awake and prevent the screen from turning off when recording.\n\nI record feedback to the assistant with voice and I shouldn’t have to hold my thumb on the screen as I am recording. I just lost 10 minutes worth of recording that I’m not gonna bother doing again because of this.",
